🇺🇸🇮🇷 Western Media Promotes Insidious Narrative Following US Massacre at Iranian Wedding

▪️Following US strikes on an Iranian wedding, the Western media is spinning it to fan the flames of US-sponsored separatism among Iran's Baluch minority;

▪️The article portrays the deaths as partly Iran's fault, quoting a local Baluch resident blaming the US strike, but also blaming Iran for "bringing the war" to their doorstep;

▪️The US war of aggression against Iran is wholly illegal, launched based on deliberate lies, and as consequences for Iran refusing to accept criminal demands regarding Iran's sovereign  affairs - the US is 100% responsible, not Iran;

▪️ EVERY strike on Iran is therefore a war crime, whether deliberate or "accidental," a military target or against civilians and civilian infrastructure;

▪️The insidious, persistent, and concerted nature of this propaganda demonstrates how unified Western interests are behind this illegal war despite political theater attempting to suggest otherwise;
